BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:neurips2026-volunteer-apply-20260901@neurips-plan.local
DTSTAMP:20260806T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260901
SUMMARY:Apply for the NeurIPS 2026 student volunteer program today (expec
 ted opening date)
DESCRIPTION:Expected opening day based on the 2025 program and not confir
 med for 2026. In 2025 applications opened on 1 September and volunteers 
 were refunded registration after two shifts of about four hours. https:/
 /neurips.cc/Conferences/2026/FinancialAssistance
